contrast-check: 6 states, both themes, none under the floor

  SIX STATES, AND THE MAP NOW DRAWS SEVEN. `.node.gone` is not in the
  contract and does not need to be: it adds no colour. It was written
  into `.node.absent`'s own selector list, so it IS absent's boundary,
  including absent's exemption - and the exemption's reason is the one
  this phase leaned on everywhere else, that the word carries it. Here
  the word is `destroyed`.

